2. Scope
   The Work includes the source code, build settings, design deliverables (kart models, textures,
   thumbnails, silhouettes, track tile models and textures, icons, onboarding illustrations, mockups,
   palette, style guide, self-synthesized sound effects, generator scripts), documentation, track
   definitions, the app name "Pinch Kart" and its screen/interaction design — except the third-party
   components listed in Section 5.

